Vipi bundles 57 local speech profiles for its eSpeak NG fallback through the upstream Swift package,
revision fd28f6460cc4cdf631528c8e2f7bd825747aac5c, under GPL version 3:
https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng-spm/tree/fd28f6460cc4cdf631528c8e2f7bd825747aac5c
The package pins its eSpeak NG and Sonic submodules. Their complete license
texts and corresponding sources belong in the release source bundle.

Mandarin pronunciation data in Vipi’s compiled eSpeak NG dictionary incorporates Unihan kMandarin readings from the Unicode Consortium and compound readings from CC-CEDICT contributors, with corrections incorporated by eSpeak NG, including contributions from the Ekho project. The historical CC-CEDICT data was offered under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported.

